<view class="page">
  <view class="header">
    <view class="title">教师绑定</view>
    <view class="subtitle">请输入研究团队线下发放的信息</view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-card">
    <view class="field">
      <view class="label">绑定码</view>
      <input
        class="input"
        value="{{bindCode}}"
        placeholder="请输入绑定码"
        maxlength="32"
        bindinput="onBindCodeInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field field-last">
      <view class="label">教师编号</view>
      <input
        class="input"
        value="{{teacherNo}}"
        placeholder="请输入教师编号"
        maxlength="64"
        bindinput="onTeacherNoInput"
      />
    </view>
  </view>

  <button
    class="submit-button"
    type="primary"
    loading="{{submitting}}"
    disabled="{{submitting || checkingExisting}}"
    bindtap="submitBinding"
  >
    验证并进入
  </button>

  <view class="note">
    绑定码仅用于连接已经线下确认参与的 Teacher Subject，不代表电子知情同意。
  </view>
</view>
